<title>FINLAND: Outokumpu details Jan-Aug production.</title>
<headline>Outokumpu details Jan-Aug production.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish mining and metals group Outokumpu Oy on Monday gave the following figures of its output of main products (tonnes unless stated)-</p>
<p>				   Jan-Aug 96   Jan-Aug 95  Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p>BASE METALS</p>
<p> Ore excavated (million tonnes)  5.0	   4.9	   7.3</p>
<p>   Copper in concentrates     19,700	20,700	31,100</p>
<p>   Nickel in concentrates     10,400	 7,800	11,200</p>
<p>   Zinc in concentrates	126,000     139,000     207,000</p>
<p>   Lead in concentrates	 30,700	29,100	46,100</p>
<p> Blister copper		   97,100	52,000	88,300</p>
<p> Cathode copper		   73,400	42,700	73,700</p>
<p> Nickel			     18,600	10,500	18,400</p>
<p> Zinc				119,000     118,000     177,000</p>
<p>Cathode copper/</p>
<p> Zaldivar(50 pct)*		25,000	  2400	11,200</p>
<p>STAINLESS STEEL</p>
<p>Chrome ore</p>
<p> excavated (million tonnes)	0.8	   0.8	   1.2</p>
<p> Ferrochrome		     158,000     158,000     232,000</p>
<p> Steel slabs		     291,000     282,000     431,000</p>
<p>Cold rolling mill production:</p>
<p>   Cold rolled products	176,000     186,000     272,000</p>
<p>   White hot strip		72,100	59,400	99,900</p>
<p> Tubes and tube fittings	15,400	16,600	24,600</p>
<p>COPPER PRODUCTS</p>
<p> Wrought copper products     271,000     269,000     407,000</p>
<p>Rolled products/Laminados</p>
<p> Oviedo-Cordoba S.A.(50 pct)*  8,300	 9,900	14,200</p>
<p>* Group's share of production in relation to ownership.</p>
<p>AVERAGE METAL MARKET PRICES</p>
<p>				    1996     1995     Change    1995</p>
<p>				   Jan-Aug  Jan-Aug    pct     Jan-Dec</p>
<p> Copper	     USc/lb     108	134    -19.4	 133</p>
<p>			FIM/kg   11.00    12.97    -15.2     12.82</p>
<p> Nickel	     US$/lb    3.52     3.72     -5.4	3.73</p>
<p>			FIM/kg   35.72    36.10     -1.1     35.95</p>
<p> Zinc		 USc/lb	47	 47	0.0	  47</p>
<p>			FIM/kg    4.72     4.59	2.8	4.50</p>
<p>Ferrochrome (Cr-content)</p>
<p>			USc/lb	56	 58     -3.4	  64</p>
<p>			FIM/kg    5.70     5.65	0.9	6.14</p>
<p> Stainless Steel  DEM/kg    3.01     4.39    -31.4	4.38</p>
<p>			FIM/kg    9.27     13.48   -31.2     13.35</p>
<p>Copper, nickel and zinc: LME cash quotations converted into US$/lb; Ferrochrome: Metal Bulletin - lumpy Cr charge, basis 52 pct Cr, free market; Stainless Steel: CRU - German transaction price (two mm cold rolled 304 sheet).</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 292</p>
